WEBVTT

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:14.740
Um... thank you for saving me when I was in trouble!

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:18.870
So... what's your name?{Could we have this disappear when she goes GACK or maybe add another subtitle reflecting it?}

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:26.240
What do you think you're doing?!

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:28.370
You're being way too bold!

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:32.370
I'm not ready for that yet!

00:00:32.370 --> 00:00:33.610
Tsubomi?

00:00:34.460 --> 00:00:37.100
Pushing us away like that was mean!

00:00:38.030 --> 00:00:42.270
I'm sorry! I just had a rather shocking dream...

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:43.680
Shocking?

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:45.310
What was it about?

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:47.480
It's a secret!

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:51.850
Mornin', Tsubomi!

00:00:55.550 --> 00:00:57.280
Good morning!

00:00:57.700 --> 00:00:59.700
It's almost time for school.

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:01.060
Shouldn't you get changed?

00:01:01.710 --> 00:01:05.940
It's already this late?! I totally forgot to get changed!

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:05.940
{OP}

00:01:07.630 --> 00:01:09.140
HeartCatch

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:10.600
Precure!

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:14.130
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:17.140
Now, all together

00:01:17.270 --> 00:01:19.650
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:19.810 --> 00:01:22.610
Let's make our flowers bloom

00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:30.240
Within each of our chests,

00:01:30.410 --> 00:01:32.910
they begin to sprout

00:01:33.160 --> 00:01:34.580
The seeds of the heart

00:01:34.750 --> 00:01:35.880
are growing

00:01:36.210 --> 00:01:38.450
bit by bit

00:01:38.530 --> 00:01:39.110
Red,

00:01:39.110 --> 00:01:39.740
white

00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:41.030
and yellow

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:43.830
It's because these blooming buds are

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:45.250
all varied colors

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:46.710
that they

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:48.920
shine so brightly!

00:01:49.770 --> 00:01:54.220
That smile that you've nurtured

00:01:55.050 --> 00:01:56.720
with such care

00:01:56.800 --> 00:01:59.430
will never wither

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:03.020
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:03.020 --> 00:02:05.900
Now, all together

00:02:05.900 --> 00:02:08.350
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:11.030
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:15.940
They're always right by our sides

00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:16.780
So together

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:20.620
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:23.580
bloom even more!

00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:25.080
HeartCatch

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:26.580
Precure!

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:36.460
So you did take my advice after all!

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:37.420
Huh?

00:02:37.420 --> 00:02:39.380
The glasses and your hairstyle.

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:46.100
I figured if I wanted to change my personality, I should start by changing my looks...

00:02:47.990 --> 00:02:50.130
You do look a lot better that way.

00:02:53.090 --> 00:02:54.690
Hey, we'd better hurry!

00:02:54.690 --> 00:02:58.340
Like I told you yesterday, it's fine if you call me Erika.

00:02:58.340 --> 00:03:01.740
Next time you don't use my name, you're gonna have to buy me a carton of milk!

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:04.180
You got i—

00:03:05.710 --> 00:03:06.730
Safe!

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:17.470
The Second Precure

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:17.470
The Second Precure

00:03:20.150 --> 00:03:21.730
Hurry, hurry!

00:03:21.730 --> 00:03:23.970
Eating lunch up here really is the best!

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:28.400
It really is nice!

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:31.350
Let's eat!

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:34.940
Hey, Tsubomi.

00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:36.180
Yes?

00:03:36.180 --> 00:03:39.690
Recently, I've been... having some kinda weird dreams.

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:43.460
About some Precure 
something-or-other getting defeated.

00:03:43.460 --> 00:03:44.870
You mean Cure Moonlight?!

00:03:45.270 --> 00:03:46.370
Yeah, that!

00:03:46.730 --> 00:03:47.830
What?!

00:03:48.430 --> 00:03:51.660
So you've been having the same dreams as me?!

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:52.750
The same dreams?

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:55.210
That means she can become a Precure!

00:03:55.950 --> 00:03:58.240
Th-The plushies are talking!

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:02.170
Why on earth were you in there?!

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:03.890
And where's my lunch?!

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:06.720
There's more important things to worry about!

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:08.720
There is?

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:12.370
This girl has what it takes to become a Precure!

00:04:12.370 --> 00:04:13.770
Right!

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:16.480
What's with these guys, Tsubomi?!

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:19.480
Th-They're the fairies that protect the Great Heart Tree...

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:20.740
I'm Coffret!

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:22.210
And I'm Chypre!

00:04:22.210 --> 00:04:24.280
Oh, so they're fairies.

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:26.410
So you understand now?

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:30.120
You said "the Great Heart Tree" just now, right?

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:34.810
Now that you mention it, that was in my dreams yesterday too.{Added the first 'that.'}

00:04:34.810 --> 00:04:35.960
Erika!

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:39.620
The dream you had while you were unconscious...{Whilst to while.}

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:40.670
was real!

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:41.580
Huh?

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:45.230
And the Cure Blossom who defeated the monster...

00:04:45.230 --> 00:04:46.580
is actually me!

00:04:46.580 --> 00:04:47.760
Seriously?!

00:04:48.060 --> 00:04:49.180
Seriously!

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:53.100
I can't believe that another 
potential Precure was so close by!

00:04:53.820 --> 00:04:57.650
Erika, become my partner Precure!

00:04:57.650 --> 00:04:59.610
Become a Precure?

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:04.580
That costume <i>was</i> really cute...

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:06.990
Wasn't it?!

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:09.520
You'll become the second Precure!

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:14.710
It's the student council president!

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:16.250
The student council president?

00:05:23.180 --> 00:05:27.590
Kurumi, I've yet to receive the list of Fashion Club members.

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:31.940
I'm sorry, President! I'll be sure to get it to you this week!

00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:36.270
Until I receive your list, we cannot produce our budget, so I urge you to make haste.

00:05:36.270 --> 00:05:37.470
Y-Yes!

00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:51.810
The student council president... is really amazing.

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:52.960
I guess.

00:05:52.960 --> 00:05:55.530
He's the grandson of the school's board chairman, you know?

00:05:55.530 --> 00:05:59.500
More importantly, we want you to become a Precure, Erika!

00:06:00.370 --> 00:06:02.440
Precures sure are neat...

00:06:03.520 --> 00:06:04.460
But...

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:07.230
Sorry, now's really not the time!

00:06:07.230 --> 00:06:08.340
Tsubomi, come give me a hand!

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:09.070
Huh?

00:06:09.070 --> 00:06:10.140
Come on, quickly!

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:12.560
Hey, hold on! Hold on, Erika!{Is the timing overlap intended here?}

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:14.970
What do we do?

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:17.100
We should consult with Cure Flower!

00:06:22.910 --> 00:06:23.820
What was that?{Sup Nightmare Before Christmas.}

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:26.940
You say a new Precure has appeared?

00:06:27.310 --> 00:06:31.170
I slipped up because her sudden
 appearance caught me off-guard.

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:36.410
If she manages to collect the Heart Seeds, she could become quite a nuisance...

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:38.830
Don't worry.

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:40.860
Cure Blossom is but one obstacle.

00:06:40.860 --> 00:06:44.710
I should be able to defeat her quite easily by myself.{Rewrote from 'I alone should be quite enough to defeat her.'}

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:46.300
I'll be off, then.

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:51.840
We need you!

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:54.000
My fellow first-years,

00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:57.560
I apologize for interrupting you during your 
lunchtime, but please listen to what we have to say!

00:06:58.310 --> 00:07:02.590
Those of you who haven't joined a club yet, come join the Fashion Club!

00:07:02.590 --> 00:07:04.770
What the heck, you're just recruiting for a club?

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:08.610
If you join the Fashion Club, you'll be able to brush up on your fashion sense,

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:11.530
and make your own trendy clothes!

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:14.490
We aren't interested in fashion. Right?

00:07:18.090 --> 00:07:20.400
Hey, Tsubomi, try to pitch in a little!

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:21.930
I have to say something too?

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:25.500
The Fashion Club is counting on you...

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:28.050
You have to speak louder than that!

00:07:28.470 --> 00:07:30.090
We beg you!

00:07:34.870 --> 00:07:37.320
In that case, we'll just have to recruit directly!

00:07:37.320 --> 00:07:38.430
R-Right!

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:39.700
If you please!

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:40.540
Don't wanna.

00:07:40.540 --> 00:07:41.590
If you please!

00:07:41.590 --> 00:07:43.220
I've already joined the tennis team...

00:07:43.220 --> 00:07:44.210
If you please!

00:07:44.210 --> 00:07:45.040
Not interested.

00:07:45.040 --> 00:07:45.860
If you please!

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:46.770
Leave me alone!

00:07:48.270 --> 00:07:50.240
Looks like this class is no good...

00:07:50.870 --> 00:07:53.330
Erika, let's move on to the next class.

00:07:54.790 --> 00:07:56.200
Over here!

00:07:56.620 --> 00:07:59.140
Hey there! Wanna join the Fashion Club?

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:02.620
I'm not joining such a pansy club.

00:08:03.530 --> 00:08:04.930
What did you say?!

00:08:04.930 --> 00:08:06.130
You listen to me...

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:09.090
Erika, come on, let's go to the next class...

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:19.120
In the end, we couldn't even get a single person to join...

00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:20.810
We'll just have to try something different tomorrow!{Edited from 'change tack' to 'try something different.'}

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:24.940
We'll bring in some of our shop's cool clothes and use those to—

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:26.720
How many times do I have to tell you?!

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:29.120
No means no!

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:32.370
Isn't that the girl from...

00:08:32.370 --> 00:08:35.750
I told you, girls aren't allowed on the soccer team!

00:08:35.750 --> 00:08:37.070
I'm begging you, please!

00:08:38.670 --> 00:08:40.290
You're interrupting our practice.

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:41.270
If you'll excuse me.

00:08:43.670 --> 00:08:46.720
Quit worrying about the soccer team and come join the Fashion Club!

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:51.450
Don't talk to me about the soccer team.

00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:54.430
And didn't I tell you I don't want to join something like the Fashion Club?{Changed the second "didn't" to "don't."}

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:56.640
Whaddya mean, "something like"?!

00:09:12.620 --> 00:09:15.310
Why can't girls join...

00:09:15.310 --> 00:09:19.200
They don't have any idea how much I love soccer!

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:25.290
<i>Hm?</i>

00:09:31.310 --> 00:09:34.570
<i>The Flower of her Heart is wilting.</i>

00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:41.310
To the right, the right!

00:09:42.610 --> 00:09:43.710
Over here!

00:09:45.070 --> 00:09:46.420
This way!

00:09:46.420 --> 00:09:47.060
Pass!

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:53.320
<i>In grade school, we played soccer 
without caring about boys and girls...</i>

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:54.440
Damn it!

00:09:58.100 --> 00:09:58.950
Who're you?!

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:21.100
I'll be taking the Flower of your Heart!

00:10:21.530 --> 00:10:24.640
Flower of the Heart, come forth!

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:34.860
Th-That's...

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:36.440
It's Sasorina!

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:38.600
The Flower of her Heart is in danger!

00:10:38.600 --> 00:10:40.410
We have to let Tsubomi know!

00:10:44.320 --> 00:10:47.680
It's your cue, Desertrian!

00:10:51.180 --> 00:10:53.960
Lure out the fairies and that Precure!

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:56.710
Ball! Baaall!

00:11:02.190 --> 00:11:04.170
Bababababall!

00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:09.230
Erika, I promise I'll help with
 recruiting tomorrow as well...

00:11:09.230 --> 00:11:11.060
so please become a Precure!

00:11:11.380 --> 00:11:13.750
Those two are completely unrelated!

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:21.710
What the heck is that giant soccer ball?!{STOP MAKING MY CUTE LITTLE GIRLS CURSE}

00:11:21.710 --> 00:11:23.440
It's Sasorina's doing!

00:11:23.440 --> 00:11:24.030
Huh?

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:25.410
It's bad news!

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:29.080
Sayaka's Flower of the Heart is the one that was stolen !

00:11:29.980 --> 00:11:30.870
This girl's...

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:35.500
For her to steal the Flower of the Heart from Sayaka...

00:11:35.770 --> 00:11:38.300
Tsubomi, transform into a Precure!

00:11:38.300 --> 00:11:38.840
Okay!

00:11:40.680 --> 00:11:42.100
I'll save her!

00:11:42.100 --> 00:11:44.020
Chypre, the Seed of the Precure!

00:11:44.020 --> 00:11:45.100
All right!

00:11:55.370 --> 00:11:57.320
Go forth, Seed of the Precure!

00:11:59.950 --> 00:12:01.370
Precure!

00:12:01.370 --> 00:12:03.250
Open My Heart!

00:12:43.330 --> 00:12:46.400
A lone flower, blooming from the earth!

00:12:49.920 --> 00:12:51.630
Cure Blossom!

00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:57.040
Wow! Super cute! It's so adorable!

00:12:57.920 --> 00:12:59.470
<i>Super</i> cool!

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:06.180
Desertrian, take your anger out on these kids!

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:10.980
You're saying that just because I'm a girl, I can't join the soccer team?!

00:13:10.980 --> 00:13:14.730
That's cruel! So cruel! So cruel!

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:14.730
It's not like it's our fault...

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:17.400
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:21.900
Why do you get to have all the fun playing soccer?!

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:25.580
Come on, everyone! Run!

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:28.620
Desertrian, get her!

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:30.080
Baaaaaall!

00:13:38.860 --> 00:13:42.290
I've loved soccer since I was a child!

00:13:42.290 --> 00:13:46.300
I thought now that I was in junior high I'd get to keep playing as much as I liked!{Added 'that' after 'now.' Downgraded 'Junior High' to 'junior high.' Can we break this line into two?}

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:48.760
You can play soccer on your own, can't you?

00:13:49.150 --> 00:13:51.280
You really do worry about such petty things.{Changed 'miniscule' (spelled wrong btw) to 'useless' to match the developing catchphrase from ep 1.}

00:13:51.280 --> 00:13:52.580
It's not petty!

00:13:52.580 --> 00:13:53.060
Hm?

00:13:53.440 --> 00:13:55.840
You're just playing with Sayaka's pure heart...

00:13:55.840 --> 00:13:59.700
Her love of soccer!

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:03.820
And I've had it up to here with this!

00:14:04.120 --> 00:14:07.110
Huh? What's with you? Just disappear already!

00:14:07.550 --> 00:14:08.550
Desertrian!

00:14:08.550 --> 00:14:09.570
Ballll!

00:14:16.390 --> 00:14:17.420
Tsubomi!

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:25.130
You should have a taste of my suffering!

00:14:31.340 --> 00:14:34.770
The Flower of her Heart will wilt soon!

00:14:34.770 --> 00:14:39.230
Unless we recover the Flower of her Heart, we won't be able to return this girl to normal!

00:14:39.610 --> 00:14:42.340
Tsubomi became a Precure to help everyone, right?

00:14:42.340 --> 00:14:43.320
That's right!

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:47.950
In order to protect the Flowers of everyone's Hearts, Blossom is fighting so hard!

00:14:49.040 --> 00:14:50.770
I'll become a Precure!

00:14:50.770 --> 00:14:51.950
You will?!

00:14:52.310 --> 00:14:53.700
I'm totally serious!

00:14:54.190 --> 00:14:57.500
I want to protect everyone's hearts too!{Moved 'too' to the end.}

00:14:58.710 --> 00:15:00.920
What's this?!

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:04.420
The Heart Perfume is resonating with Erika's heart!

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:08.810
So Erika really does have what it takes to become a Precure!

00:15:16.570 --> 00:15:18.980
Desertrian, crush her!

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:20.450
I won't let that happen!

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:25.730
Who the hell are you?!

00:15:25.730 --> 00:15:27.530
I'm Kurumi Erika!

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:29.490
The second Precure!

00:15:39.270 --> 00:15:41.910
Go forth, Seed of the Precure!

00:15:44.610 --> 00:15:45.880
Precure!

00:15:45.880 --> 00:15:47.830
Open My Heart!

00:16:28.950 --> 00:16:31.790
A lone flower, swaying in the sea breeze!

00:16:35.100 --> 00:16:36.360
Cure Marine!

00:16:40.130 --> 00:16:40.930
A second one?!

00:16:42.430 --> 00:16:43.870
Cure Marine!

00:16:43.870 --> 00:16:48.040
How did you transform into a
 Precure without being told how?!

00:16:48.040 --> 00:16:49.980
I saw it in my dream yesterday!

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:55.070
As for the name... After you asked me to become one this morning, I spent the whole time thinking about it!

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:01.580
Leave this to me! Just rest!

00:17:02.090 --> 00:17:03.080
Cure Marine!

00:17:03.400 --> 00:17:04.250
Yup!

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:06.850
All right then, I'll be your opponent!

00:17:06.850 --> 00:17:08.000
Come get some!

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:10.690
Why are you spacing out, Desertrian?!

00:17:10.690 --> 00:17:12.460
Get her, quickly!

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:13.790
Baaall!

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:18.190
The same trick won't work on me!

00:17:19.090 --> 00:17:20.890
The top of your head is one big weak spot!

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:34.280
Ball!

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:39.830
Marine Shoot!{WHERE IS THE EFFECT FOR THIS I HAVE EXPECTATIONS OF THIS GROUP}

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:48.250
Cure Marine, you have to take back the Flower of her Heart!

00:17:48.550 --> 00:17:50.210
I already know that!

00:17:58.660 --> 00:18:01.390
Gather, Floral Power!

00:18:02.740 --> 00:18:04.530
Marine Tact!

00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:15.780
Flowers, glitter bright!

00:18:19.300 --> 00:18:23.620
Precure Blue Forte Wave!

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:49.020
We did it!

00:18:49.020 --> 00:18:50.520
Curse you!

00:18:51.380 --> 00:18:53.440
This time, you'll be facing me!

00:18:53.810 --> 00:18:57.680
Sasorina, if you're going to continue your evil deeds...

00:18:59.870 --> 00:19:01.700
then <i>we</i> will be your opponents!

00:19:02.020 --> 00:19:04.130
Damn you, Precures!

00:19:04.130 --> 00:19:07.370
I'll let you off for today!

00:19:10.270 --> 00:19:12.190
We did it, Cure Marine!

00:19:12.190 --> 00:19:13.110
Yay!

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:16.720
Cure Marine, hurry and return this girl to normal!

00:19:16.720 --> 00:19:18.210
To normal!

00:19:18.210 --> 00:19:19.130
Right!

00:19:25.910 --> 00:19:27.270
The Fashion Club girls...

00:19:27.690 --> 00:19:29.010
What have I...

00:19:29.010 --> 00:19:33.570
It seems you overworked yourself 
while practicing and collapsed here.

00:19:33.570 --> 00:19:35.360
Oh...

00:19:36.240 --> 00:19:37.010
Here.

00:19:37.010 --> 00:19:38.380
Oh, thanks.

00:19:41.140 --> 00:19:42.160
What's wrong?

00:19:43.170 --> 00:19:45.760
I had this dream.

00:19:46.380 --> 00:19:50.630
A weird dream where I turned a 
soccer ball monster and ran wild...

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:54.340
I've had the wrong idea.

00:19:54.340 --> 00:19:58.100
I thought that just because I was a girl, I couldn't play soccer in junior high.

00:19:58.100 --> 00:20:00.720
I got caught up in my thoughts and got depressed.

00:20:01.020 --> 00:20:03.080
You love soccer, though, don't you?

00:20:03.080 --> 00:20:04.770
Yes! I love it!

00:20:05.390 --> 00:20:08.850
That's why I'm going to start a girls' soccer team!{Added the apostrophe for possessiveness.}

00:20:08.850 --> 00:20:10.310
That sounds great!

00:20:11.620 --> 00:20:15.400
All right, then! I need to follow your example and start recruiting!{Examples to example.}

00:20:15.740 --> 00:20:16.750
Bye!

00:20:18.760 --> 00:20:19.950
Go for it, okay?

00:20:19.950 --> 00:20:21.070
Fight hard!

00:20:21.460 --> 00:20:23.440
Thank goodness!

00:20:23.440 --> 00:20:27.580
In the language of flowers, a poinsettia means "My heart is aflame!"

00:20:28.190 --> 00:20:32.040
I'm sure Sayaka will become a great female soccer player!{Changed "womens'" to "women's"}

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:36.290
I think a Heart Seed is going to be born!

00:20:49.900 --> 00:20:50.850
Oh, that's right!

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:52.630
I forgot about this...

00:20:52.630 --> 00:20:55.060
Here. The doll you gave me yesterday.

00:20:55.060 --> 00:20:56.560
You fixed it for me?!

00:20:58.430 --> 00:21:01.120
It's so cute! Thank you, Erika!

00:21:01.120 --> 00:21:02.940
Oh, it's Mako!

00:21:06.880 --> 00:21:10.190
Could this doll possibly be yours?

00:21:10.190 --> 00:21:11.200
Yeah!

00:21:12.660 --> 00:21:16.920
I'm terribly sorry! She lost it at the park yesterday, you see.

00:21:17.360 --> 00:21:19.210
Is that so?

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:23.720
You see, your dolly here got hurt, so this nice girl fixed it for you!

00:21:25.140 --> 00:21:27.970
Sorry for the bother. Thank you very much.

00:21:27.970 --> 00:21:30.720
Come on, thank the nice girl.

00:21:31.360 --> 00:21:32.560
Miss...

00:21:33.210 --> 00:21:34.270
Thank you!

00:21:34.940 --> 00:21:36.560
You're quite welcome!

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:39.020
Bye bye, miss!

00:21:39.020 --> 00:21:40.530
Bye bye!

00:21:41.220 --> 00:21:44.420
It sure feels nice to do a good deed!

00:21:44.420 --> 00:21:45.820
It sure does!

00:21:45.820 --> 00:21:49.530
Erika, let's both do our best as Precures from now on!

00:21:50.800 --> 00:21:52.160
Let's do our best at recruiting too!

00:21:52.620 --> 00:21:53.450
Right!

00:21:55.190 --> 00:21:57.210
Man, I'm starving.

00:21:57.210 --> 00:21:59.840
We didn't get a chance to eat our lunch, after all!

00:22:00.140 --> 00:22:02.550
I know a really delicious crepe place.

00:22:02.550 --> 00:22:04.350
Let's go eat there, Tsubomi!

00:22:04.350 --> 00:22:05.810
All right, Erika!

00:22:09.890 --> 00:22:09.920
{ED}

00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:18.810
HeartCatch!

00:22:20.560 --> 00:22:21.730
HeartCatch!

00:22:23.440 --> 00:22:24.650
HeartCatch!

00:22:24.940 --> 00:22:27.610
HeartCatch Precure!

00:22:33.620 --> 00:22:36.160
The flower blooms with an "Open sesame!"

00:22:36.790 --> 00:22:39.120
In the wardrobe of my heart

00:22:39.670 --> 00:22:42.290
are all the things that a girl loves

00:22:42.590 --> 00:22:44.750
Look, they're packed in so tight

00:22:45.300 --> 00:22:48.130
My makeover was a huge success

00:22:48.470 --> 00:22:50.720
thanks to this scrunchie and this frilly tunic!

00:22:51.430 --> 00:22:53.720
Our girly showtime

00:22:54.100 --> 00:22:56.560
is about to begin!

00:22:57.060 --> 00:22:59.770
Is my coordination lookin' good today?

00:22:59.890 --> 00:23:02.690
Shuffle! Colorful! Beautiful!

00:23:02.980 --> 00:23:05.610
Mismatches are just part of my character v(^^)v

00:23:05.860 --> 00:23:07.150
We're pretty

00:23:07.320 --> 00:23:08.950
at full bloom!

00:23:09.610 --> 00:23:12.070
If you polish your heart

00:23:12.490 --> 00:23:15.120
until it shines

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:16.660
Then even the darkness

00:23:16.830 --> 00:23:20.920
will become a guiding light

00:23:21.290 --> 00:23:23.920
So don't sulk

00:23:24.130 --> 00:23:26.840
because a smile's the best!

00:23:27.010 --> 00:23:30.300
Let's make them bloom, facing the sun

00:23:30.380 --> 00:23:33.510
The flowers of our hearts

00:23:35.180 --> 00:23:36.390
HeartCatch!

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:39.850
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:42.440 --> 00:23:45.900
<i>People grow through continuous 
meetings and farewells, Blossom!</i>

00:23:45.900 --> 00:23:50.450
<i>Does that mean that I'm so useless and pitiful that I don't have the right to team up with you, Marine?!</i>

00:23:50.450 --> 00:23:53.390
<i>That's not so! It is the light that shines within your heart!</i>

00:23:53.390 --> 00:23:56.330
<i>People can't survive alone! That's why we combine our strength!</i>

00:23:56.330 --> 00:23:58.790
<i>Now, put your heart into the Flower Tact and shout...{SUP ZELOS}</i>

00:23:58.790 --> 00:24:01.210
<i>Precure Floral Power Fortissimo!</i>

00:24:02.250 --> 00:24:03.750
HeartCatch Precure<i>:</i>

00:24:03.750 --> 00:24:06.670
The Precure Partnership

00:24:03.750 --> 00:24:06.670
The Precure Partnership

00:24:06.670 --> 00:24:08.630
<i>We'll catch everyone's hearts!</i>
